{
  "name": "WhatsApp lead qualification",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WhatsApp lead qualification\n\n**What it does**\nQualifies new WhatsApp leads over a few messages. AI pulls out name, need, budget and timing, the lead is saved and updated in Google Sheets, missing details are asked for, and leads that fit get your calendar link. It also stores the click-to-WhatsApp ad click ID for workflow 10.\n\n**You need**\n- A WhatsApp Business Cloud API number in a Meta app\n- OpenAI API key\n- Google Sheets connected to n8n\n\n**Setup**\n1. Create a Google Sheet with a tab named `Leads` (headers in the README) and paste its ID into both Google Sheets nodes.\n2. In **Decide the next step**, set your minimum budget, maximum wait and calendar link.\n3. Connect WhatsApp, OpenAI and Google Sheets, activate, and message your number from your phone.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 760,
        "width": 560
      },
      "id": "6c24281e-1a29-57d3-ba2a-d8cc551dc34f",
      "name": "WhatsApp lead qualification",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -400
      ]
    },
